It began with getting her dad into walking football after his diagnosis =E2=
=80=93 now Gemma Darvill is taking a national team on tour to Canada


Gemma Darvill helped set up the England women=E2=80=99s Parkinson=E2=80=99s=
 team and is their first head coach.


Tom Garry


When Gemma Darvill=E2=80=99s dad, Les, was diagnosed with Parkinson=E2=80=
=99s disease aged 58, joining a walking football team stopped him from conf=
ining himself to his own home, and she believes the game saved his life.

What she could never have foreseen was that, eight years later, she would f=
ind herself coaching
