<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">While London has a host of top-flight club=
s and Liverpool have been regular contenders, the story of the Premier Leag=
ue can almost entirely be told with Mancunian main characters.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">From Manchester United=E2=80=99s decade-pl=
us of dominance under Sir Alex Ferguson to Manchester City=E2=80=99s emerge=
nce among the oil baron class, with a grip made firmer under Pep Guardiola=
=E2=80=99s guidance, it seems one must always beat a Manchester club to the=
 title. Never before has the trophy spent more three seasons before returni=
ng to one of these two clubs, with a pair of three-year roadshows in the mi=
d-2000s and mid-2010s.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">After Liverpool=E2=80=99s win in 2024-2025=
 and Arsenal=E2=80=99s title last season, we may be in the final year of a =
similar passage. While United entered the season with optimism fuelled by t=
heir greater stability than most of their rivals and City=E2=80=99s lofty a=
spirations regardless of which bald man patrols the technical area, neither=
 club was a popular pick to stop Arsenal from a repeat. If Sunday=E2=80=99s=
 Manchester Derby is any indication, both sides are still a ways from hitti=
ng the Gunners=E2=80=99 level.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">This matchup has always carried more raw p=
assion than most rivalries. That feistiness remains. Phil Foden=E2=80=99s f=
irst-half red card meant the game struggled to find a regular tempo, forcin=
g City to back off of their more ambitious ideas a quarter of the way in.</=
p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">United, for the most part, failed to make =
the most of the numerical advantage in their 1-0 loss. Only three of their =
16 attempts on goal were on target, while City won a greater share of both =
ground and aerial duels. As Harry Maguire got baited by Enzo Fern=C3=A1ndez=
=E2=80=99s chicanery, City eventually leaned into Erling Haaland, who spurn=
ed United among other suitors to join City in the summer of 2022.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">City will continue to revel in that signin=
g. Regardless of how the tactical approaches for this matchup have changed =
over time, it remains true that instinctive strikers who can wring a half l=
ook out of nothing are rare. Just look at United=E2=80=99s efforts at findi=
ng their own version. Marcus Rashford spends too long on the wing to operat=
e with the same central instincts. Rasmus H=C3=B8jlund had his shot. Benjam=
in =C5=A0e=C5=A1ko and Matheus Cunha are alternating at present. But in a g=
ame with so few clear looks, a toenail=E2=80=99s worth of opportunity made =
all the difference.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">And what an odd sequence that was. It take=
s some straining of human understanding to suggest that Fern=C3=A1ndez=E2=
=80=99s full-stretch dive towards the ball didn=E2=80=99t constitute an int=
entional effort to be involved in the play. Pro Ref, the organization that =
oversees refereeing in the Premier League, has at least admitted the ruling=
 was in error. But in the moment, there was simply chaos. Claiming Haaland =
was onside by the thinnest of windows while being unable to show the crucia=
l 3D VAR still frame, coupled with Michael Oliver=E2=80=99s decision to not=
 announce clarification of the ruling, left all involved in disbelief.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Then again, the nature of the winner only =
drives home how little separates the two, both a bit below a customary titl=
e winner=E2=80=99s boil. While United=E2=80=99s passing has improved early =
in Carrick=E2=80=99s first full season, it=E2=80=99s hard to pick what is a=
 more damning statistic: their 26.2% strike accuracy or their 37.5% tackle =
success rate, which may be more telling. As for City, the expensive efforts=
 to replace Rodri will take some time to settle, and the auxiliary attacker=
s around Haaland still aren=E2=80=99t operating with dependability.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">So, two points dropped for United and two =
found by City with an unusual assist from the booth. Maresca=E2=80=99s men =
are level on points with Arsenal, but time will tell whether they can susta=
in that challenge all season.</p>
